1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Flux: people and AI agents, one project.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:14,500
You come back after a break. Flux shows what changed.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:26,500
A message becomes a task, in one action.

4
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Decisions keep their reason, and a person accepts them.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:51,500
Your own agent joins only the project you choose.

6
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:03,500
It reads the project and answers in your client.
Your account, your model; Flux never sees it.

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:17,500
Hand work to the agent. Someone else can pick it up.

8
